AB  - Lipidomics analysis method is a comprehensive and systematic analysis and identification of lipid metabolites and interacting molecules, which can reveal the relationship between lipid metabolism and physiological or pathological processes of cells, organs and even the body. The development of lipidomics analysis method has not only been limited to the auxiliary verification of pathology in clinically diagnosed patients, but has gradually developed into a means of prospective prediction of disease occurrence and monitoring of disease progression. This article mainly summarizes the application progress of lipidomics analysis method in children s health and disease. © 2023 Editorial Office of Chinese Journal of Child Health Care
