AB  - Gestational diabetes mellitus (GDM) is a serious threat to maternal and infant health. However, the unclear etiology and pathogenesis of GDM is the harrier of clinical intervention. In recent years, the relationship between inflammation and GDM has been widely concerned, but the conclusions are inconsistent. This paper summarizes the research progress on the association between inflammation-related indicators and GDM, in order to provide a basis for the diagnosis, treatment, or prophylaxis of GDM. © 2023 Authors. All rights reserved.
