TI  - Association of Leptin and Retinol Binding Protein 4 with the Risk of Gestational Diabetes: A Systematic Review and Meta‑Analysis of Observational Studies
PY  - 2023
T2  - Indian Journal of Endocrinology and Metabolism
VL  - 27
IS  - 2
SP  - 96
EP  - 104
