TI  - ADROPIN AS A POTENTIAL PROTECTIVE FACTOR OF METABOLIC COMPLICATIONS IN OBESE PREGNANT WOMEN WITH HYPERGLYCAEMIA DIAGNOSED IN EARLY PREGNANCY
PY  - 2023
