TI  - A Critical Review on the Nutritional and Medicinal Profiles of Garlic’s (Allium sativum L.) Bioactive Compounds
PY  - 2023
T2  - Food Reviews International
VL  - 39
IS  - 9
SP  - 6324
EP  - 6361
