TI  - A Comprehensive Analysis of Chinese, Japanese, Korean, US-PIMA Indian, and Trinidadian Screening Scores for Diabetes Risk Assessment and Prediction
PY  - 2022
T2  - Mathematics
VL  - 10
IS  - 21
