TI  - Serum Fetuin-A and Risk of Gestational Diabetes Mellitus: An Observational Study and Mendelian Randomization Analysis
PY  - 2022
T2  - Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism
VL  - 107
IS  - 9
SP  - E3841
EP  - E3849
