TI  - Patchouli alcohol suppresses inflammation and autophagy, and reduces osteoclast formation in periodontitis via regulation of ERK and NF-κB signaling pathways
PY  - 2022
T2  - Tropical Journal of Pharmaceutical Research
VL  - 21
IS  - 8
SP  - 1607
EP  - 1613
