TI  - Benefits of Physical Exercise as Approach to Prevention and Reversion of Non-Alcoholic Fatty Liver Disease in Children and Adolescents with Obesity
PY  - 2022
T2  - Children
VL  - 9
IS  - 8
C7  - 1174
