TI  - The association between age at first pregnancy and number of deliveries with metabolic syndrome and its components: Results from Persian Guilan Cohort Study (PGCS)
PY  - 2022
T2  - Iranian Journal of Obstetrics, Gynecology and Infertility
VL  - 25
IS  - 6
SP  - 1
EP  - 11
