TI  - Visit-to-Visit Fasting Glucose Variability in Young Adulthood and Nonalcoholic Fatty Liver Disease in Middle Age
PY  - 2022
T2  - Journal of Clinical Endocrinology and Metabolism
VL  - 107
IS  - 6
