TI  - Habitual Dietary Fiber Intake, Fecal Microbiota, and Hemoglobin A1c Level in Chinese Patients with Type 2 Diabetes
PY  - 2022
T2  - Nutrients
VL  - 14
IS  - 5
C7  - 1003
