TI  - Intervention Effects of Okra Extract on Brain-Gut Peptides and Intestinal Microorganisms in Sleep Deprivation Rats
PY  - 2022
T2  - Evidence-based Complementary and Alternative Medicine
VL  - 2022
C7  - 9855411
