TI  - Postconditioning with Irisin Attenuates Lung Ischemia/Reperfusion Injury by Suppressing Ferroptosis via Induction of the Nrf2/HO-1 Signal Axis
PY  - 2022
T2  - Oxidative Medicine and Cellular Longevity
VL  - 2022
C7  - 9911167
