AB  - Over the past 50 years,complications from diabetes mellitus,including blindness,kidney failure,amputations,heart attacks and strokes,have become a major cause of death. The main mechanism of diabetes mellitus is related to the intake of delicious and high-calorie refined food. Fasting treatment,as a non-pharmacological intervention,is of great significance in the treatment of metabolic diseases such as obesity and diabetes mellitus. In this paper,the mechanism of fasting treatment in type 2 diabetes mellitus is reviewed. © The Author(s) 2021.
