TI  - The therapeutic use of the zonulin inhibitor at-1001 (Larazotide) for a variety of acute and chronic inflammatory diseases
PY  - 2021
T2  - Current Medicinal Chemistry
VL  - 28
IS  - 28
SP  - 5788
EP  - 5807
