TI  - Effects of different exercise intensities on visfatin level and glucose metabolism in type 2 diabetic rats
PY  - 2020
T2  - Chinese Journal of Tissue Engineering Research
VL  - 24
IS  - 26
C7  - 2095-4344(2020)26-04196-05
SP  - 4196
EP  - 4200
