TI  - Long-Term Vitamin D Supplementation and the Effects on Recurrence and Metabolic Status of Cervical Intraepithelial Neoplasia Grade 2 or 3: A Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled Trial
PY  - 2018
T2  - Annals of Nutrition and Metabolism
VL  - 72
IS  - 2
