TI  - Comparative occurrence of diabetes in canine, feline, and few wild animals and their association with pancreatic diseases and ketoacidosis with therapeutic approach
PY  - 2018
T2  - Veterinary World
VL  - 11
IS  - 4
SP  - 410
EP  - 422
