TI  - A Randomised, Controlled Study of Different Glycaemic Targets during Gestational Diabetes Treatment: Effect on the Level of Adipokines in Cord Blood and ANGPTL4 Expression in Human Umbilical Vein Endothelial Cells
PY  - 2018
T2  - International Journal of Endocrinology
VL  - 2018
C7  - 6481658
