TI  - Associations of lifestyle factors (smoking, alcohol consumption, diet and physical activity) with type 2 diabetes among American adults from National Health and Nutrition Examination Survey (NHANES) 2005–2014
PY  - 2017
T2  - Journal of Diabetes
VL  - 9
IS  - 9
SP  - 846
EP  - 854
