UR  - https://www.scopus.com/inward/record.uri?eid=2-s2.0-85046135736&doi=10.1016%2fB978-0-12-409547-2.12287-5&partnerID=40&md5=05127660fcdf4f694b2712d87d4e59bb
AB  - Life without food is not possible as it provides nutrient that nourish our body and keep our system working in good condition. The quality of life mainly depends on what we eat, and hence nutrition and its impact on health are very important. Nutraceuticals are naturally derived bioactive compounds that help in improving health, preventing chronic diseases, delaying the aging process, increasing life expectancy, and supporting the structure or function of the body. Fruits and vegetables comprise major part of nutraceuticals as they contain carbohydrates, dietary fibers, vitamins, and minerals. The development of novel concept of nutraceuticals is considered to play a vital role in disease prevention in addition to being nutrient providers. This article summarizes the most important health benefits of nutraceuticals. © 2017 Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.
