AB  - The annual survey of graduate programs at U.S. universities and colleges was conducted in the spring of 2015 to compile a list of theses and dissertations completed in 2014 in family and consumer sciences areas of interest. For the survey, requests for the titles and authors were sent via email to institutions three times within a six-week period. Forty-four colleges and universities responded to the survey. A total of 356 theses and 177 dissertations were reported. A report of those submissions, by subject category, author, and title, is provided. © 2015 American Association of Family and Consumer Sciences.
