TI  - A Consideration of Biomarkers to be Used for Evaluation of Inflammation in Human Nutritional Studies
PY  - 2013
T2  - British Journal of Nutrition
VL  - 109
IS  - SUPPL. S1
SP  - S1
EP  - S34
