TI  - Long-term consequences of maternal high-fat feeding on hypothalamic leptin sensitivity and diet-induced obesity in the offspring
PY  - 2007
T2  - American Journal of Physiology - Regulatory Integrative and Comparative Physiology
VL  - 293
IS  - 3
SP  - R1056
